OpenH264 build inputs and independent EdgeFFmpeg Wasm adapter.

source.patch adapts Cisco OpenH264 v2.7.0 commit
1bca62311e447fd9c39fc93de2c4b96cd5ce971c. Original copyright notices and
BSD-2-Clause terms are retained in each modified file and LICENSE.OpenH264.
The wrapper contains no compiled FFmpeg implementation.
Progressive POC type1/2 calculations and MMCO5 metadata access are independent
SDK-side adaptations. The TypeScript display scheduler receives the reset
boundary separately from the key-picture flag.

Compiler runtime libraries carry separate notices. A build output is not a
completed distribution package; source-specific runtime notices and source
packaging require review. SDK sample-media rights are separate from the SDK
source-code license.

The separate TypeScript presentation/parameter-set adaptations are in
packages/avcodec/src/h264, with their LGPL-2.1-or-later notices and source.
